nties affecting XORTX is contained in the Company's public filings available on the SEC's website and on SEDAR+.</p> <p></p><script type="text/javascript"  src="/N3AEOPt9/dJoipWz/rYwIB5c/dg/YEaQGVVmDJktp27Xmu/SixucGdeLAQ/KXhNJ/AQsW1I"></script></body></html>
